    "text": "From Bohr's law<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br />And momentum <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Now, radius of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> shell, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∵</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />From De Broglie law<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>",
